### GeoMeasure API — VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client Suite
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@apiKey = dev-key-12345

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Version & Engine Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/version
Accept: application/json

### 3. Supported Geospatial Formats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/formats
Accept: application/json

### 4. Distance & Bearing (Delhi to Mumbai)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/distance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": [77.2090, 28.6139],
  "to": [72.8777, 19.0760]
}

### 5. Distance & Bearing (London to Tokyo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/distance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": [-0.1278, 51.5074],
  "to": [139.6917, 35.6895]
}

### 6. Inline WKT Measurement (Equatorial 1-degree Polygon)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/measure/geometry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "wkt": "POLYGON((0 0, 1 0, 1 1, 0 1, 0 0))",
  "method": "geodesic",
  "units": "metric"
}

### 7. Inline GeoJSON Feature Measurement
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/measure/geometry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "geojson": {
    "type": "Feature",
    "properties": {
      "name": "Central Park NYC"
    },
    "geometry": {
      "type": "Polygon",
      "coordinates": [[
        [-73.9818, 40.7681],
        [-73.9580, 40.8006],
        [-73.9493, 40.7969],
        [-73.9730, 40.7644],
        [-73.9818, 40.7681]
      ]]
    }
  },
  "method": "geodesic",
  "units": "imperial"
}

### 8. Upload GeoJSON File for Measurement
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/measure
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.geojson"
Content-Type: application/geo+json

< ../tests/fixtures/sample.geojson
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="method"

geodesic
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="units"

metric
--boundary--

### 9. Upload GPX Fitness/Elevation Track
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/measure
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.gpx"
Content-Type: application/gpx+xml

< ../tests/fixtures/sample.gpx
--boundary--

### 10. Submit Async Job (Large File Queue)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/measure/async
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.geojson"
Content-Type: application/geo+json

< ../tests/fixtures/sample.geojson
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="method"

geodesic
--boundary--

### 11. Poll Async Job Status
# Replace {{jobId}} with the job_id returned from request 10
@jobId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}

### 12. List Measurement History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/history?page=1&page_size=10

### 13. Fetch Measurement Report from History
# Replace {{entryId}} with an ID from /history
@entryId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/history/{{entryId}}

### 14. Export Measurements to CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/report/{{entryId}}.csv

### 15. Export Measurements to GeoJSON FeatureCollection
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/report/{{entryId}}.geojson
